computer terminology in English in metaphorical, and producing anything in
Lojban with lujvo is extremely difficult, naljvajvo, and somtimes cimjvo.
In my honest opinion, the ideal solution for pretty much any computer
terminology would be to create zi'evla, based on a cimjvo. lujvo are
powerful, I don't deny it, but sometimes, the learning curve incurred by a
new zi'evla is justified by virtue of the counterpart lujvo's length and
rule-adhesion, not to mention that there are some very specific places that
would be nice to include in some computer-related terms that we just can't
get out of existing gismu.

